 "sents": [
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "Every morning, ",
     "m": "每天早上"
    },
    {
     "t": "our development team ",
     "m": "我们开发团队"
    },
    {
     "t": "has a short stand-up meeting ",
     "m": "开一次简短站会"
    },
    {
     "t": "to share progress ",
     "m": "分享工作进展"
    },
    {
     "t": "and coordinate the day's work.",
     "m": "并协调当天任务"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "Each person explains ",
     "m": "每个人说明"
    },
    {
     "t": "what they completed yesterday, ",
     "m": "昨天完成了什么"
    },
    {
     "t": "what they plan to do today, ",
     "m": "今天计划做什么"
    },
    {
     "t": "and whether anything is blocking their progress.",
     "m": "以及是否有阻碍"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "I try to keep my update specific ",
     "m": "我尽量汇报具体"
    },
    {
     "t": "instead of saying ",
     "m": "而不是只说"
    },
    {
     "t": "that I am simply working on a feature.",
     "m": "自己在开发某功能"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "For example, ",
     "m": "例如"
    },
    {
     "t": "I might say ",
     "m": "我可能会说"
    },
    {
     "t": "that I finished the login validation ",
     "m": "登录验证已完成"
    },
    {
     "t": "and am now connecting the user profile page ",
     "m": "正在连接用户资料页"
    },
    {
     "t": "to the API.",
     "m": "到 API 接口"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "If I have a blocker, ",
     "m": "如果遇到阻碍"
    },
    {
     "t": "I explain ",
     "m": "我会说明"
    },
    {
     "t": "what I have tried ",
     "m": "试过哪些方法"
    },
    {
     "t": "and what kind of help I need.",
     "m": "需要什么帮助"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "This makes it easier ",
     "m": "这样更容易"
    },
    {
     "t": "for a teammate ",
     "m": "让队友"
    },
    {
     "t": "to offer useful advice ",
     "m": "提供有用建议"
    },
    {
     "t": "or take action after the meeting.",
     "m": "或在会后采取行动"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "I also mention risks early, ",
     "m": "我也会尽早提示风险"
    },
    {
     "t": "especially when a task ",
     "m": "尤其是某项任务"
    },
    {
     "t": "may take longer than expected.",
     "m": "可能超出预期"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "The goal is not ",
     "m": "目的并不是"
    },
    {
     "t": "to give a long technical presentation ",
     "m": "做冗长技术演讲"
    },
    {
     "t": "or prove how busy I am.",
     "m": "或证明自己多忙"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "It is a quick way ",
     "m": "这是一种快捷方式"
    },
    {
     "t": "to make sure ",
     "m": "用来确保"
    },
    {
     "t": "everyone understands the team's current priorities.",
     "m": "所有人都清楚当前重点"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "If a discussion needs more time, ",
     "m": "如果讨论需要更多时间"
    },
    {
     "t": "we arrange a separate conversation ",
     "m": "我们会安排单独沟通"
    },
    {
     "t": "with the relevant people.",
     "m": "与相关人员一起"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "A clear update ",
     "m": "清晰的进展汇报"
    },
    {
     "t": "helps the team spot problems early ",
     "m": "帮助团队及早发现问题"
    },
    {
     "t": "and avoid duplicated work.",
     "m": "并避免重复劳动"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
